  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:HnLond">Hn Lond</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="13" corresp="#wit-rs">Et omnes debitores qui civibus debita sua debent, eis reddant vel in Londoniis se disrationent quod non debent.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-rs">And all those who owe debts to citizens shall pay them or shall clear themselves in London from the charge of being in debt to them.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 290–291 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
    </body>
